Package: modelscales
Title: Nested Scales and Multi-Dimensional Indexes for Modeling
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Date: 2026-10-04
URL: https://optimal2050.github.io/modelscales/r/,
    https://optimal2050.github.io/modelscales/,
    https://github.com/optimal2050/modelscales
BugReports: https://github.com/optimal2050/modelscales/issues
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Oleg",
           family = "Lugovoy",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "olugovoy@optimalsolution.dev",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5546-9875"))
Description: A dimension-agnostic representation of nested discrete scales for
    optimization and simulation models: a flat table of atoms plus the ordered
    frames that group them, conversion of data between resolutions, and
    combination of several scales into a product index. Time and space are
    provided by the companion packages 'timescales' and 'geoscales'; any other
    dimension - industries, income brackets, temperature regimes - is declared
    directly.
